Hi!  BioGeoBEARS itself lives on GitHub now. You still get the dependencies from CRAN:
https://github.com/nmatzke/BioGeoBEARS

library(devtools)
devtools::install_github(repo="nmatzke/BioGeoBEARS")

Cheers!
Nick

