Hi everyone,

I ran the example script using example data (Hawaiian Psychotria), but the results (Table 1) were a little bit different from those displayed under the example script (Table 2). For example, parameter d was 1.000000e-07 for model BAYARELIKE+J in Table 1, but it was actually 1.000000e-12 in Table 2. Could anyone explain why?

Thanks in advance!

Table 1
                    LnL numparams            d            e         j      AIC
DEC           -34.54196         2 3.506813e-02 2.842703e-02 0.0000000 73.08392
DEC+J         -20.94759         3 1.000000e-12 1.000000e-12 0.1144013 47.89518
DIVALIKE      -33.14968         2 4.474851e-02 1.000000e-12 0.0000000 70.29935
DIVALIKE+J    -21.08621         3 1.000000e-12 1.000000e-12 0.1157061 48.17242
BAYAREALIKE   -40.33442         2 1.868714e-02 3.058760e-01 0.0000000 84.66885
BAYAREALIKE+J -21.55265         3 1.000000e-07 1.000000e-07 0.1081174 49.10530

